    "intro_narrative": "You stand in the dim, chaotic office of Arthur Pendelton, an enigmatic cryptographer who vanished without a trace three weeks ago. The room is a labyrinth of jury-rigged mainframes, biometric lockboxes, and humming processors. Your objective is simple but daunting: breach Arthur's ultimate security measure, the main vault, to uncover the truth behind his disappearance. To do so, you must navigate his complex array of custom cryptographic machines, tracing the data flow from his encrypted notes to the final security console. Time is ticking, and whoever took Arthur might be coming back. Can you decipher the master cryptographer's final puzzle before it's too late?",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
